# The Spirit is made by the ability's controller, who is the Traveler's controller as it died (CR 603.3a, 603.10a), not its
# owner. Bot2's Sudden Substitution exchanges its own Lightning Bolt (aimed at Bot1) for Bot1's Traveler: Bot2 now controls
# the Traveler, Bot1 the Bolt, and Bot1 aims it at the Traveler. It dies under Bot2's control: the card goes to its owner
# Bot1's graveyard, but the Spirit token goes to Bot2 and Bot1 gets nothing. No life changes.

